      "Why it matters for BB + action — Ingest GSE303646 raw TXT files via the standard scRNA-seq pipeline (CellRanger + Seurat/Scanpy + Harmony/scVI + CellRank/Monocle3 + SCENIC+ + CellChat/NicheNet), identify-cell-type-clusters (canonical-markers: EPCAM/KRT19/KRT8 for epithelial; SFTPC/SFTPB/SFTPD/AGER/AQP5 for AT1-AT2; SCGB1A1 for club; KRT5/KRT14 for basal; COL1A1/COL1A2/PDGFRB/ACTA2 for fibroblast; CDH5/PECAM1/VWF for endothelial; CD45/PTPRC for immune; CD68/MRC1 for macrophage), stratify-by-age (young-vs-aged) + injury-status (uninjured-vs-day-3-vs-day-7-vs-day-14-vs-day-28-post-injury), compute-senescence-scoring (CDKN2A, CDKN1A, LMNB1-dowregulation, SASP-cytokine-set: IL6, IL1B, CXCL1, CXCL8, TNF, CCL2), compute-regeneration-trajectory-from-AT2-to-AT1 + from-fibroblast-to-myofibroblast, identify-failed-regeneration-cell-states (persistent-fibroblast-activation + failed-AT2-proliferation + senescent-cell-accumulation), cross-reference with public-lung-aging-atlases (the Angelidis-2019-lung-aging-tabula-muris, the aged-lung-fibroblast-atlas, the IPF-atlases [Adams-2020, Habermann-2020, Morse-2024, Tsukui-2024, Strunz-2020, Xu-2024]) + senolytic-trial-data (dasatinib-plus-quercetin-Phase-2, fisetin-Phase-2, UBX0101-discontinued, navitoclax-Phase-1-2, FOXO4-DRI-preclinical) + SASP-inhibitor-data (rapamycin-Phase-2, metformin-Phase-2, JAK-inhibitor-Phase-2), and package as a candidate list of (a) lung-aging-clock-foundation-model (SASP-cytokine-based + epigenetic-clock-based + telomere-length-based integrated-lung-aging-clock); (b) young-vs-aged-fibroblast-state-classifier; (c) failed-regeneration-biomarker-panel; (d) senolytic-combinations-for-IPF-prevention (D+Q + navitoclax, fisetin + metformin, FOXO4-DRI + rapamycin); (e) AT2-stem-cell-regeneration-therapy strategies (small-molecule-regeneration-agonists, Wnt-pathway-agonists, Notch-pathway-modulators); (f) cross-organ-aging-comparison (lung-vs-liver-vs-kidney-vs-skin-senescent-cell-burden); (g) IPF-aging-vulnerability-stratification-biomarker-panel; (h) senomorphic-vs-senolytic-strategy-comparison-for-lung; (i) lung-regeneration-foundation-model-training-data; and (j) lung-aging-and-cardiac-aging-crosstalk-via-SASP. The first deliverable should be a 3-page lung-regeneration-aging-bridge + senescent-fibroblast-burden + IPF-aging-vulnerability-stratification brief.",
      "Signal 3 — Longevity + Aging-Heart + LMNA-Dilated-Cardiomyopathy + Nuclear-Envelope-Rupture + LINC-Complex-Reversible-Mechanism / Nuclear envelope rupture in cardiomyocytes orchestrates early transcriptomic changes and immune activation in LMNA-DCM that are reversed by LINC complex disruption [LMNA-cardiac-aging nuclear-envelope-rupture-LINC-disruption-reversibility atlas]: GSE307910 (score 4, n=4, Mus musculus, Other [single-nucleus-RNA-seq + perturbation], pdat 2026/09/08 = 10 days ago, raw MTX+TSV files, raw_file_availability 'yes', watcher query 'muscle fibrosis spatial transcriptomics' [query-routing artifact — actual subject is LMNA-cardiac-nuclear-envelope-rupture]) is the FRESHEST NOVEL LMNA-DCM / nuclear-envelope-rupture / LINC-complex-disruption-reversibility / progerin-driven-cardiac-aging atlas in the entire 2026-09-18 hits.jsonl. LMNA (lamin-A/C, gene-on-chromosome-1q22) encodes the nuclear-envelope-scaffold-protein, with dominant-mutations-causing-autosomal-dominant-Emery-Dreifuss-muscular-dystrophy, dilated-cardiomyopathy-with-conduction-defects (LMNA-DCM, ~6-8% of familial-DCM, ~30-40K-US-carriers), Dunnigan-type-familial-partial-lipodystrophy, mandibuloacral-dysplasia, and Hutchinson-Gilford-progeria-syndrome (HGPS, ~1-in-4M-live-births, premature-aging-with-cardiovascular-death-at-median-age-14.6). The progerin-protein (a-truncated-LMNA-product-from-a-cryptic-splice-site) accumulates with age in normal-cells, drives nuclear-envelope-blebbing-and-rupture, and is a key mechanism-of-cardiovascular-aging-and-cardiac-fibrosis. The LINC-complex (Linker-of-Nucleoskeleton-and-Cytoskeleton, SUN1-SUN2-nesprin-SYNE1-SYNE2-emerin-EMD) couples the nuclear-envelope-to-the-cytoskeleton-and-extracellular-matrix-via-mechanotransduction. The study's finding-that-LINC-complex-disruption-REVERSES-LMNA-DCM-cardiomyocyte-transcriptomic-and-immune-activation-changes is a major mechanistic-reversibility finding — it suggests that interventions-targeting-nuclear-mechanics, cGAS-STING-immune-activation (downstream-of-nuclear-envelope-rupture-releasing-double-stranded-DNA-into-cytoplasm), or LINC-complex-modulation-could-revert-progerin-driven-aging-cardiac-changes.",
      "Four-axis score — peptide 1/5 (LINC-complex-disruption could potentially be achieved via dominant-negative-SUN-domain-peptides, FAK-inhibitor-peptide-mimetics, or mechanotransduction-blocking-peptides — though the current study uses genetic perturbation, not peptide therapy); AI-agent infrastructure 5/5 (LMNA-DCM-nuclear-envelope-rupture-LINC-disruption-reversibility atlas is the canonical foundation-layer input for AI-DD nuclear-mechanobiology-target-nomination AND for AI-agent design of progeria-therapy-stratification-pipelines, LMNA-mutation-classifier-foundation-models, and cardio-longevity-biomarker-panels); longevity 5/5 (LMNA-driven-aging, progerin-accumulation, nuclear-envelope-rupture, cGAS-STING-immune-activation, and cardio-longevity are central mechanisms-of-aging-and-age-related-cardiovascular-disease); cost 4/5 (n=4 single-nucleus-RNA-seq dataset is moderate-burden — small-N but with-rescue-experiment-providing-causal-validation). The signal is actionable from the BB longevity + AI-DD service stack as an LMNA-cardiac-aging + nuclear-envelope-rupture + LINC-complex-reversibility + progerin-cGAS-STING brief.",
