      "Signal 3 — Bioinformatics + Longevity + Rare-Disease + LAM/TSC mTOR-Crosstalk + Spatial-Niche + Companion-to-id:93 / Decoding Lymphangioleiomyomatosis (LAM) Niche Environment via Integrative Analysis of Single Cell Multiomics and Spatial Transcriptomics [LAM-niche single-cell + ATAC + spatial companion atlas]: GSE302356 (watcher score 6, n=12, Homo sapiens, Expression profiling + Genome binding/occupancy profiling + Other [scRNA-seq + ATAC-seq + spatial], pdat 2026/07/30 = 42 days ago, raw TAR files) is the FRESHEST NOVEL LAM-lymphangioleiomyomatosis / single-cell + ATAC + spatial companion atlas in the entire 2026-09-11 hits.jsonl and the FIRST LAM-specific niche atlas since the id:93 GSE341690 TSC-cortical-tuber-brain-organoid atlas on 2026-09-08 explicitly flagged LAM-crosstalk as a follow-on opportunity. Lymphangioleiomyomatosis (LAM) is a rare-neoplastic-cystic-lung-disease occurring sporadically (S-LAM, ~1-in-400K) or in association with TSC (TSC-LAM, ~30-40% of female-TSC-patients). Standard-of-care includes sirolimus (FDA-approved 2015 based on MILES-trial) and everolimus. The niche-environment framing strongly-suggests scRNA-seq + spatial + ATAC-multiomics to dissect-LAM-niche-cellular-heterogeneity, identify-novel-cell-types (smooth-muscle-like-LAM-cells with TSC2-loss, lymphatic-endothelial-cells, fibroblast-like-support-cells, immune-cells), map-spatial-organization, and use-ATAC-for-chromatin-accessibility-landscape-for-master-regulator-identification via SCENIC+.",
      "Four-axis score — peptide 0/5 (LAM-therapies are rapalogs); AI-agent infrastructure 5/5 (LAM-niche scRNA-seq + ATAC + spatial is the canonical-foundation-layer-input for AI-DD rare-disease-target-nomination, mTOR-pathway-foundation-model-training, master-regulator-identification-via-SCENIC+); longevity 5/5 (LAM has implications for pulmonary-aging and TSC-multi-organ-aging; rapalog-repurposing-for-longevity is an active-research-area); cost 4/5 (n=12 LAM-niche multiomics atlas is moderate-burden). The signal is actionable from the BB longevity + clinical + bioinformatics + AI-DD service stack as a LAM-niche + mTORC1-rapalog-repurposing + TSC-multi-organ-companion-atlas brief.",
      "Why it matters for BB + action — Ingest GSE302356 raw TAR files via the standard LAM-multiomics pipeline (CellRanger + Seurat/Scanpy + Harmony/scVI + ArchR/Signac + SCENIC+ + SpaceRanger/Squidpy + CellChat/NicheNet), identify-LAM-cell-specific-DEGs, identify-LAM-cell-chromatin-accessibility-changes-via-ATAC, identify-LAM-niche-spatial-organization, run-pseudotime-from-healthy-smooth-muscle-cell-to-LAM-cell-state (Slingshot/CellRank/Monocle3), identify-novel-LAM-master-regulators via SCENIC+, cross-reference with public-LAM-atlases + TSC-atlases + DepMap-LAM-cell-lines + MILES-trial-data + MULTISTARS-LAM-trial + ATS-LAM-clinical-practice-guidelines-2024, and package as (a) LAM-specific-mTORC1-pathway-biomarker-panel (pS6-Ser240-244-IHC, p4E-BP1-IHC), (b) novel-LAM-master-regulators-as-AI-DD-targets, (c) rapalog-combination-strategies-for-LAM (sirolimus + hydroxychloroquine, sirolimus + navitoclax, sirolimus + metformin, sirolimus + senolytic-D+Q), (d) rapalog-repurposing-for-TSC-multi-organ-manifestations, (e) LAM-specific-cell-cell-communication-pathway-targets (VEGF-C/VEGFR3, PDGF-PDGFR, CSF1-CSF1R, PD-L1-PD-1), (f) mTORC1-pathway-foundation-model-training-data, (g) longevity-rapalog-prototype-trial-designs, and (h) LAM-pulmonary-versus-uterine-versus-renal-comparative-biology. The first deliverable should be a 3-page LAM-niche + mTORC1-rapalog-repurposing + TSC-multi-organ-companion-atlas brief.",
